{"id":"majeur","lemma":"majeur","pos":"adj","rank":4378,"glosses":["greater, larger, more important","of great importance, main, major, principal, greatest","major, adult, of age (who has attained the age of majority, who is over the legal age of majority)"],"ipa":"/ma.ʒœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/95/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-majeur.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-majeur.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"majeure","masculinePlural":"majeurs","femininePlural":"majeures"},"formAudio":{"majeure":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-majeure.wav","majeurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-majeurs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le majeur est le plus long doigt.","en":"The middle finger is the longest.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"long"},{"g":"finger"}]},{"text":"C'est une crise majeure.","en":"This is a major crisis.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"crisis"},null]},{"text":"Ce n'est pas un problème majeur.","en":"It's not a major problem.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"problem"},null]},{"text":"La douleur a en majeure partie disparu.","en":"The pain has mostly gone away.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"pain"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"part"},{"g":"disappeared"}]},{"text":"Nous n'avons eu aucun accident majeur.","en":"We haven't had any major accidents.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one"},{"g":"accident"},null]}]}